               <td>NIPCO LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,620.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AITEO</td>\n                <td>₦1,625.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>A.Y.M SHAFA</td>\n                <td>₦1,665.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ZAMSON</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO WARRI</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>RAINOIL DELTA</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,651.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>BULK STRATEGIC</td>\n                <td>₦1,665.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Nigeria Targets End to Crude Exports as Local Refining Capacity Surges\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Federal Government has unveiled plans to gradually phase out crude oil exports as Nigeria ramps up domestic refining capacity. The Chief Executive of the Nigerian Midstream and Downstream Petroleum Regulatory Authority, Rabiu Umar, disclosed the strategy on Monday. He said the country’s expanding refining infrastructure, driven by large-scale private investments and modular refineries, could transform Nigeria into Africa's leading refining hub.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/nigeria-targets-end-to-crude-exports-as-local-refining-capacity-surges\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Oil Prices Climb as Iran Denies Talks with U.S\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Brent crude futures climbed above $85 per barrel after tumbling more than seven per cent on Monday. WTI crude also recovered above the $81 mark. Monday's sell-off followed Trump's announcement that he had suspended another planned military strike against Iran. Iran's Foreign Ministry quickly rejected the claim.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/oil-prices-climb-as-iran-denies-talks-with-us\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Trump Pressures Oil Giants to Slash Fuel Prices as Crude Crashes 5%\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    U.S. President Donald Trump has called on American oil companies to immediately reduce retail fuel prices. Crude benchmarks tumbled sharply following his decision to suspend another planned military strike on Iran. Trump also singled out Chevron Chief Executive Officer Mike Wirth.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/trump-pressures-oil-giants-to-slash-fuel-prices-as-crude-crashes-5\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Petroleumprice.ng Opens Portal for 2026 Industry Recognition and Awards\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Petroleumprice.ng Recognition & Awards celebrates individuals, fuel stations, depot owners, advocates and organisations whose contributions continue to strengthen Nigeria's downstream petroleum industry. This year's awards recognise achievements in six categories: Best Fuel Station of the Year, Female Petroleum Depot Owner of the year, Most Innovative Downstream Organisation of theyear.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/petroleumpriceng-opens-portal-for-2026-industry-recognition-and-awards\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    OTL Africa Announces 5% Discount on Delegate Registration for 2026 Energy Week\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    TL Africa has announced a 5 per cent discount on delegate registration for the OTL Africa Downstream Energy Week 2026. The discount applies to delegate registration packages for the event, which holds its conference and exhibition from October 26 to 29, 2026, in Lagos.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/otl-africa-announces-5-discount-on-delegate-registration-for-2026-energy-week\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
